{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.4,
   "text": "It allows you to use your home like a credit card up to X amount, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 3.66,
   "end": 7.26,
   "text": "And the interest rate on this is much less than credit cards, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.42,
   "end": 11.12,
   "text": "So I usually take out a HELOC on my primary, which I still have one."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.3,
   "end": 14.82,
   "text": "And I use that to lend on other people's flips, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.96,
   "end": 15.98,
   "text": "People that I know, like, and trust."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.22,
   "end": 19.78,
   "text": "And I've seen their track record to know that they're pretty good at this thing."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.9,
   "end": 24.44,
   "text": "And I'll use my HELOC to invest in their flips and just make sure the spreads enough."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.56,
   "end": 28.42,
   "text": "So for example, if my HELOC costs, you know, 8%, you know, and then I talk to this"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.42,
   "end": 31.68,
   "text": "person, they're giving me 20% or 15% or 16%."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.68,
   "end": 35.78,
   "text": "I just make a decision on, hey, is that enough that I'm making moving forward and go."
  }
 ],
